==Special==

'''Sneak attack:''' increases by +1d6 every three levels after 10th.

'''Summon fiend:''' does not improve without the [[epic fiendish servant]] feat, despite in-game documentation to the contrary.

==Notes==

*Requires [[Shadows of Undrentide]].
* The blackguard's sneak attack [[stack]]s with the [[rogue]]'s [[sneak attack]] and the [[assassin]]'s [[death attack]].
*The epic fiendish servant feat is available only as an epic bonus feat.
